 "imp-f-berne-arriv-e-du-roi-de-siam": {
  "imdbID": "tt0377489",
  "imdbRating": "5.0",
  "imdbVotes": "85",
  "Poster": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BY2ZiZjg5N2UtMzYxNy00MmNkLWE5NzQtYWNhMTNkMzk4ZjNlXkEyXkFqcGdeQXVyMjA0NzcwMjI@._V1_SX300.jpg",
  "Ratings": [
   {
    "Source": "Internet Movie Database",
    "Value": "5.0/10"
   }
  ],
  "Plot": "Berne: Arrivée du roi de Siam (1897) This Lumiere film clocks in at just under a minute and shows a parade of what appears to be police officers on horses. If you're looking for an early film that broke new grounds and took cinema history into a new direction then sadly you will not see it here. With that said, this is certainly interesting because it shows you a moment in time. It was fascinating getting to see what was being shown off in this parade as well as getting to see the outfits that were being worn. Again, there's nothing ground-breaking here but if you're a fan of these type of actuality movies then you should enjoy this."
 },
