 "imp-f-procession-s-ville-iii": {
  "imdbID": "tt1741567",
  "imdbRating": "5.5",
  "imdbVotes": "77",
  "Ratings": [
   {
    "Source": "Internet Movie Database",
    "Value": "5.5/10"
   }
  ],
  "Plot": "Procession a Seville III (1897) The title pretty much tells you what happens in this Lumiere film. A funeral procession is going down the street. That's it. Yes, this actuality film is an entertaining one because it allows you to see how this type of procession was done back in the day and it also offers up some other fun items. This includes being able to look at the various style of clothing that was being worn and there's even a funny moment at the start of the film where a cop seems to be upset and screaming for people to get out of the way of the camera. This also makes one think that the scene was staged or at least the people were willing to \"get it right\" for the camera.This and various other titles from the Lumiere Brothers can be viewed online at sites including YouTube."
 },
